{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wildwood: Graveyard Defense</strong>\u00a0is a whimsical, top-down wave defense game. Pop ghosts with your lantern, collect ecto to brew potions, and explore the graveyard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211180/extras/3489241ac66eb7847dd8bbcf5426b0c2.poster.avif?t=1769811469\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211180/extras/3489241ac66eb7847dd8bbcf5426b0c2.webm?t=1769811469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Potions:</strong>\u00a0Buff your base stats with temporary potions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lanterns:</strong> Unlock new lanterns each with unique properties and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills:</strong> Experiment with  permabuffs and create different builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore:</strong> Unlock new levels and discover secrets in your graveyard</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211180/extras/9271b29de7d652de046aaf69eb72475b.poster.avif?t=1769811469\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211180/extras/9271b29de7d652de046aaf69eb72475b.webm?t=1769811469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced active combat with simple controls (not an auto-shooter)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of casual fun, sometimes chaotic situations, and a little bit of strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End-game challenges and high-score leaderboards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211180/extras/5bdcf2f7e5a81508e47c4a7c19e42547.poster.avif?t=1769811469\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211180/extras/5bdcf2f7e5a81508e47c4a7c19e42547.webm?t=1769811469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, I'm Alan and I'm so excited for you to play Wildwood!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a solo indie developer. I originally launched a prototype version of Wildwood on mobile in 2019 and decided to take the next step and make it a full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm expanding the original gameplay, adding new mechanics, new enemies, and an entirely new progression system. I'm also working on some end-game content for anyone who wants even more challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please wishlist, and stay tuned for more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3211180?t=1769811469","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211180/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769811469","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211180/1bb867e7fb206ced9c179e9c3a94acec682f8a5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769811469","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211180/1bb867e7fb206ced9c179e9c3a94acec682f8a5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769811469","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4101090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wildwood: Graveyard Defense</strong>\u00a0is a whimsical, top-down wave defense game. Pop ghosts with your lantern, collect ecto to brew potions, and explore the graveyard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211180/extras/3489241ac66eb7847dd8bbcf5426b0c2.poster.avif?t=1769811469\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211180/extras/3489241ac66eb7847dd8bbcf5426b0c2.webm?t=1769811469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Potions:</strong>\u00a0Buff your base stats with temporary potions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lanterns:</strong> Unlock new lanterns each with unique properties and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills:</strong> Experiment with  permabuffs and create different builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore:</strong> Unlock new levels and discover secrets in your graveyard</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211180/extras/9271b29de7d652de046aaf69eb72475b.poster.avif?t=1769811469\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211180/extras/9271b29de7d652de046aaf69eb72475b.webm?t=1769811469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced active combat with simple controls (not an auto-shooter)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of casual fun, sometimes chaotic situations, and a little bit of strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End-game challenges and high-score leaderboards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211180/extras/5bdcf2f7e5a81508e47c4a7c19e42547.poster.avif?t=1769811469\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211180/extras/5bdcf2f7e5a81508e47c4a7c19e42547.webm?t=1769811469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, I'm Alan and I'm so excited for you to play Wildwood!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a solo indie developer. I originally launched a prototype version of Wildwood on mobile in 2019 and decided to take the next step and make it a full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm expanding the original gameplay, adding new mechanics, new enemies, and an entirely new progression system. I'm also working on some end-game content for anyone who wants even more challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please wishlist, and stay tuned for more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Alan Vitek"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211180/6d600474966a86805f599469ddbf002b8d5374c6/header.jpg?t=1769811469","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 14 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</